WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.190
Cwm Idwal, in Eryri, North Wales.

2
00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:07.890
The lake, Llyn Idwal, lies
below a steep rock wall.

3
00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:11.150
Darwin spent many hours here
with the geologist Adam Sedgwick,

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.150
looking for fossils.

5
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.150
Neither of them saw what
was all around them.

6
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.950
Years later, Darwin wrote that a house
burnt down by fire did not tell its story

7
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.290
more plainly than this valley.

8
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.550
So what was the story he missed?

9
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.030
A buried volcano?

10
00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.610
An ancient river channel?

11
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:32.490
In this mission, you'll learn the field
techniques for reading a landscape like

12
00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:36.670
this: mapping, clast shape
and sediment structure.

13
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:40.750
Then you'll test competing
explanations against the field data.

14
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.510
Your mission: find out what
Darwin missed in Cwm Idwal.
